In this directory there are four subdirectory:
  source: f77 source files + Makefile.
  script: compile script and test run script file.
  testin: input files for testruns.
  testout: output file for testruns.

You must make sure there are library routine to BLAS and the library path in Makefile is
correct.  In particular, dspgv subroutine.
